 "description": "<p>A stage-costume take on Christmas dressing: patchwork patent leather set in red, with M for 40-55 kg and L for 55-65 kg. The patchwork construction gives the outfit visual breaks that flat red would not.</p>\n<p>Patent leather on a stage set is a deliberate choice - it catches spotlight and flash photography in a way matte fabric never does. The pieces work as one silhouette with the patch seams doing the design work.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Item type: full set</li>\n<li>Style: Christmas stage, patchwork</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-55 kg), L (55-65 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order by weight. Built for performances, themed parties, and any room with a light rig.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red patchwork patent leather stage set for Christmas, M and L sizes covering 40-65 kg.</p>\n",
